SUMMARY:[Kayaking] Annual Kayak Klinic 
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nOur annual Kayak Klinic!\n\nNew to kayakin
 g? Want to try kayaking? Need help installing a roof rack or tying your ka
 yak to the car? What safety equipment do you need?\n\nHave a kayak and wan
 t to get out and kayak with friends?\n\nJoin us to answer these questions 
 and get help to prepare for a great kayaking summer. I will have some expe
 rienced kayakers to answer questions and help you out.\n\nThe event will b
 e held at the Caesarea Municipal Ramp Boat Launch ([https://maps.app.goo.g
 l/1273omu8gRMC88Ud8](https://maps.app.goo.gl/1273omu8gRMC88Ud8)).\n\n**Ple
 ase Note:** There is very limited parking in this area and we would like t
 o reserve this area for those bringing a kayak. If you're renting\, please
  consider car-pooling. Please observe all No Parking areas and be respectf
 ul of the surrounding neighbourhood.\n\n**Kayak Rental**\nFor those withou
 t a kayak\, we have partnered with Freedom Canoe & Kayak ([http://freedomc
 anoe.com/](http://freedomcanoe.com/)) in Caesarea to rent a kayak. (4 Ceda
 r Grove Dr\, Caesarea). You can visit or call (289-200-4737) to arrange yo
 ur rental. They will arrange to get the kayak to the launch site.\n\n**NOT
 E**: All kayaking events will require the proper safety equipment and that
  you wear your lifejacket when in/on the water.\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND 
 LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the event fee (if appli
 cable)\, you are confirming that you have read\, understand and accept the
  following:\n\n1. GTA Hiking Meetup is a private group. Attending events i
 s voluntary by you as a member. Participation in any activity with us is a
 t your own risk.\n2. By joining this event as a member you agree to indemn
 ify and hold harmless its organizers\, co-organizers\, assistant organizer
 s\, event hosts\, and other members from all claims or liability of every 
 type (including court costs and legal fees) for injury or death to any per
 son or for damage to property\, loss of personal property or any other wro
 ngful act arising out of or relating to your participation as a member. Th
 is agreement applies to you and to other persons (as your guests) who may 
 accompany you in these endeavors.\n3. You also agree to hold the organizer
 s as well as other group members harmless. By participating voluntarily in
  the group\, you expressly waive any and all such claims against each and 
 every other member in the group\, including without limitation any and all
  claims against the group organizer\, co-organizers\, assistant organizers
 \, and event hosts.
